{"id":"vod_bf_16584","vodId":"16584","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"精灵使的剑舞","name_cn":"精灵使的剑舞","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/15740facb5dbae4cbb0003fdef1e1a8d.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在艾雷西亚精灵学院之中，在这里学习深造的都是出身名门的千金大小姐们，她们要学会如何成为一名合格的精灵使。风早神人（古川慎 配音）是一名平凡的十六岁少年，一次意外之中，他撞见了少女克雷尔（木户衣吹 配音）出浴时的模样，又在误打误撞之中和她签订了契约，就这样，风早神人成为了学院之中唯一的男性精灵使。　　成熟可靠温文尔雅的琳丝蕾特（优木加奈 配音），一本正经循规蹈矩的艾莉丝（石上静香 配音），表面看来大大咧咧但内心却十分娇羞的菲雅娜（大西沙织 配音），在这些可爱女孩子们的围绕下，神人会有着怎样趣味横生的校园生活呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:00:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016fR6EVebsindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016PNfg4bMOindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016A0xY2r0hindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016fQj9efgZindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016y61Vu4tOindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016BSO2lJTXindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016jo19cBKqindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016qeXBZiGKindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016vfLqLf9Hindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016CLjIRVNBindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016Kd99WBJ0index.m3u8/index.m3u